{"id":"bd1ef961-f5d1-50a1-aded-0895dc63ebc7","title":"内容库与版本","icon":"🗂️","cover":"none","parentId":"884a4104-344d-51e1-a1cd-c1f80f892d20","favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T06:42:07.645Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-15T06:42:07.645Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"内容库与版本","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"title":"你的页面存在哪里、怎样保存","lead":"ShowAI 把你的项目、页面、组件和模板都存在本机的一个内容库里。这一页说明内容存在哪里、保存怎样避免覆盖别人的修改、冲突出现时怎么处理，以及怎样备份和整理空间。","facts":[{"label":"默认位置","value":"~/.showai"},{"label":"正式内容","value":"SQLite 数据库"},{"label":"版本标识","value":"hash + revision"},{"label":"页面历史","value":"只保留当前内容"}],"actions":[{"label":"多设备同步","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/project-server","primary":true},{"label":"CLI 与 MCP 参考","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/cli"}],"art":"start"},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-f6762b61"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-f57629ce"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"内容库在哪里"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"桌面 App、本地浏览器版和 CLI 默认都使用 "},{"type":"text","text":"~/.showai","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。几个入口指向"},{"type":"text","text":"同一个目录","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"时，看到的就是同一批项目；Agent 在一个入口里保存的页面，工作台里立刻能读到。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f476283b"}},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"换一个位置：「设置 → 通用 → 内容库 → 选择内容库」。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e553850"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b0e06eef"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"CLI 和 Agent：用 "},{"type":"text","text":"--home PATH","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 或环境变量 "},{"type":"text","text":"SHOWAI_HOME","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 指定内容库。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-341bfdbb"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-afe06d5c"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不指定项目时，CLI 按当前目录（所在 Git 仓库的根目录）找到对应项目；"},{"type":"text","text":"--project","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 可以明确指定。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4f2c95a"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b2e07215"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f37626a8"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"点开下面的目录看每一部分的作用。只有 "},{"type":"text","text":"history/content.sqlite","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 是权威数据，其余要么由它生成，要么只属于这台设备。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fa7631ad"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-tree","version":"1.0.0","props":{"initial":".showai/history/content.sqlite","caption":"一个新建内容库的目录结构（省略了锁文件和临时文件）","nodes":[{"name":".showai","kind":"dir","summary":"一个内容库","open":true,"detail":"整个目录就是一个内容库。备份、迁移或交给另一个入口使用时，都以整个目录为单位。","children":[{"name":"library.json","kind":"file","summary":"内容库的格式与标识","detail":"记录格式版本、存储方式和内容库 ID。当前格式为 2，存储方式为 `sqlite`。","example":"{\n  \"format\": \"showai-library\",\n  \"version\": 2,\n  \"storage\": \"sqlite\",\n  \"id\": \"e32a2ff5-…\"\n}","exampleLang":"json"},{"name":"history","kind":"dir","summary":"正式内容所在目录","open":true,"detail":"目录名沿用旧版本以保持兼容，**并不表示这里保存了页面历史**。","children":[{"name":"content.sqlite","kind":"file","badge":"权威","summary":"事务型 SQLite 数据库","detail":"保存所有项目的当前内容：页面元数据和内容节点、按摘要寻址的图片等资源、组件与模板的精确依赖、并发令牌和操作回执。每次保存在一个事务里完成。"}]},{"name":"workspace","kind":"dir","summary":"可读文件，由数据库生成","detail":"方便你和外部工具直接浏览的 JSON 文件。直接修改这里的文件不会悄悄覆盖正式内容：ShowAI 会把外部修改记录下来，等你决定怎么处理。","children":[{"name":"projects","kind":"dir","open":true,"children":[{"name":"<项目 ID>","kind":"dir","open":true,"children":[{"name":"project.json","kind":"file","summary":"项目名称、文件夹和绑定的来源目录"},{"name":"pages","kind":"dir","children":[{"name":"<页面 ID>.json","kind":"file","summary":"一个页面的完整文档","detail":"格式见[页面文件格式](https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/file-format)。"}]},{"name":"conflicts","kind":"dir","badge":"同步时出现","summary":"跨设备冲突的来源记录","detail":"同步无法自动合并时生成 `conflicts/<ID>/record.json`，记录原文件、双方的来源版本和保留下来的副本页面 ID。"}]}]}]},{"name":"local","kind":"dir","badge":"仅本机","summary":"只属于这台设备，不同步","detail":"编辑器草稿、冲突快照、同步基线和恢复日志都在这里。它们不会上传到服务器，但会被完整归档一起保存。","children":[{"name":"editor-drafts","kind":"dir","summary":"编辑器里尚未保存的草稿"},{"name":"conflicts","kind":"dir","summary":"外部文件修改的快照"},{"name":"sync","kind":"dir","summary":"同步基线、上传回执和中断恢复稿"},{"name":"transactions","kind":"dir","summary":"未完成事务的恢复日志"},{"name":"receipts","kind":"dir","summary":"操作回执，用来识别重复请求"}]}]}]},"integrity":"sha256-74d9519ab11b450f4d2feec3813ad0e0d8a26b3d1c93510a74c9a765e1578215"},"id":"node-f976301a"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-f8762e87"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"保存时发生了什么"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"每次保存都是一个事务：内容、当前文件指针、并发令牌和操作回执一起写入数据库，成功后再生成可读文件。即使进程在中途被强制结束，下次打开时恢复日志也会把可读文件补齐。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f7762cf4"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"每个页面带两个版本标识："},{"type":"text","text":"hash","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（内容摘要）和 "},{"type":"text","text":"revision","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（资源令牌）。保存时必须带上读取时拿到的这两个值。只要页面在此期间被别人改过——哪怕又改回了原样——这次保存就会被拒绝，而不是悄悄覆盖别人的修改。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ee761ec9"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"📌","tone":"sand","id":"node-ed761d36"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"内容库只保留每个页面的当前内容。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 被新保存替换掉的数据在不再被引用后会被回收，因此不能浏览或恢复页面的旧版本。想留住某个时间点的状态，请按下文做一次完整归档，或者把页面导出一份。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-af81f271"}}]},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"给 Agent 和脚本：带版本标识保存","open":false,"id":"node-67041ada"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"先完整读取一次，记下返回的 "},{"type":"text","text":"hash","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 和 "},{"type":"text","text":"revision","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，再用它们保存或应用修改："}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b971b74d"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"sh","id":"node-b871b5ba"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"showai pages read PAGE --project PROJECT --json\nshowai pages apply PAGE --project PROJECT --input operations.json \\\n  --base-hash HASH --base-revision REVISION --json"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"返回 "},{"type":"text","text":"CONFLICT","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 时不要只换上新的 hash 重新提交原来的整页内容：先重新读取，比较后有意识地合并，或者放弃这次修改。"},{"type":"text","text":"--operation-id","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 只在重试"},{"type":"text","text":"同一个","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"请求时复用；用同一个 ID 提交不同的修改会被拒绝。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b771b427"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-68041c6d"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"草稿与冲突"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你在编辑器里的修改先成为本机草稿，输入过程中自动保存；草稿记住打开页面时的那一份基础版本，用来分辨哪些修改是你的。下面是编辑器和 Agent 同时修改同一页面时的完整过程，点「下一步」逐步查看。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-650417b4"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-sequence","version":"1.0.0","props":{"title":"同一页面同时被你和 Agent 修改","actors":[{"id":"you","label":"你","sub":"工作台编辑器","icon":"🧑‍💻","tone":"brand"},{"id":"lib","label":"内容库","sub":"~/.showai","icon":"🗂️","tone":"slate"},{"id":"agent","label":"Agent","sub":"MCP 或 CLI","icon":"🤖","tone":"violet"}],"steps":[{"from":"you","to":"lib","label":"打开页面（revision r1）","kind":"call","detail":"编辑器读取当前内容，把 r1 记作草稿的基础版本。"},{"from":"you","to":"you","label":"编辑，草稿自动保存","kind":"note","detail":"草稿保存在 `local/editor-drafts`，关闭窗口也不会丢。"},{"from":"agent","to":"lib","label":"基于 r1 保存修改","kind":"call","detail":"Agent 读取时拿到的也是 r1，它先保存成功。"},{"from":"lib","to":"agent","label":"已保存，变为 r2","kind":"reply"},{"from":"you","to":"lib","label":"基于 r1 保存草稿","kind":"call"},{"from":"lib","to":"you","label":"拒绝：版本已变化","kind":"reply","detail":"编辑器显示「保存失败：请处理冲突」。草稿原样保留，自动保存不会把它当作已保存。"},{"from":"you","to":"you","label":"比较并合并草稿","kind":"note","detail":"互不相关的修改自动合并；重叠的地方并排列出「共同基础」「我的草稿」「正式版本」，由你选择或直接编辑合并后的页面数据。"},{"from":"you","to":"lib","label":"保存合并版本（基于 r2）","kind":"call","detail":"也可以选择「放弃修改，载入当前文件」，或「保留草稿并返回」稍后再处理。"},{"from":"lib","to":"you","label":"已保存，变为 r3","kind":"reply"}]},"integrity":"sha256-54ea7e21b2eb7835fb0ba41ca4d48f1ab21bc27b88b7f8fa2b03d3b910b05e76"},"id":"node-66041947"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"node-6304148e"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"三种冲突，三种处理方式"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"情况"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-78f4a4d6"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3d8b5139"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"会发生什么"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1e1cd001"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3c8b4fa6"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你要做什么"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-23e3630c"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3b8b4e13"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-684c034e"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"同一台设备上的保存冲突：另一个窗口、Agent 或 CLI 先保存了"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-54136bf9"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3814700e"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"本次保存明确失败，草稿保留"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4e9c8ace"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-391471a1"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在冲突界面比较后保存合并结果，或放弃修改并载入当前版本"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7dc5bf2f"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-36146ce8"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-694c04e1"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"外部文件修改：用编辑器或脚本直接改了 "},{"type":"text","text":"workspace","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 里的文件"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b10f29d0"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-673da46f"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"外部版本先保存为快照，相关内容暂停发布；组件和模板先恢复为可编辑草稿"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d6d5ef3b"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-663da2dc"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"点顶栏的「查看外部文件修改」，选择导入、合并或放弃；组件草稿修好后保存为新版本"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a7acbada"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-693da795"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-664c0028"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"跨设备同步冲突"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a4600db3"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6214e224"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"无法自动合并时，双方内容都保留为普通页面，标题注明账号和设备"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1f3814e8"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6314e3b7"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"见"},{"type":"text","text":"项目服务器与团队协作","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/project-server"}}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9aadecdd"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6414e54a"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-674c01bb"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-64041621"}},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"在 CLI 中处理冲突","open":false,"id":"node-61041168"},"content":[{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"sh","id":"node-977537af"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 列出、查看并处理外部文件修改\nshowai workspace conflicts --project PROJECT --json\nshowai workspace conflict CONFLICT_ID --json\nshowai workspace resolve CONFLICT_ID --resolution discard|import|merge --json\n\n# 外部改动了组件或模板包：保留为可编辑草稿，修好后发布新版本\nshowai workspace recover-package CONFLICT_ID --project PROJECT --json\n\n# 预览草稿与当前内容的合并；加上 --revision 当前版本 才会保存\nshowai workspace merge PAGE --project PROJECT --input draft.showai.json --base-revision BASE --json"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-620412fb"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"搜索整个内容库"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在侧栏搜索框把范围切换到「整个内容库」，可以同时搜索页面正文、嵌套容器、组件参数、组件与模板的说明和源码，再按类型筛选：全部内容、页面正文、组件、模板、源码或项目。中文关键词同样适用。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5f040e42"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"搜索索引可以随时重建，建立索引时不会执行组件代码。Agent 和脚本使用同一个索引："}],"attrs":{"id":"node-60040fd5"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"sh","id":"node-e1010951"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"showai search --query \"季度预算\" --project PROJECT --kind page --json"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-e00107be"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"备份与恢复"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"完整归档是内容库目录的一份已核验副本：正式内容、可读文件、本机草稿和恢复数据都在里面，可以重建的搜索索引和缓存不复制。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-df01062b"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"打开「内容库空间管理」","body":"进入「设置 → 通用」，在「内容库空间管理」里找到「完整归档」。"},{"title":"填写归档保存位置","body":"输入一个**尚不存在的新文件夹**的完整路径，它不能位于当前内容库内部。已有的文件夹不会被覆盖。","variants":[{"label":"工作台","code":"/Volumes/Backup/showai-2026-10-15"},{"label":"CLI","code":"showai library archive --out /Volumes/Backup/showai-2026-10-15 --json"}]},{"title":"保存并自动核验","body":"点击「保存完整归档」。ShowAI 先复制到临时目录，为每个文件记录 SHA-256 摘要写入 `archive.json`，核验无误后才改名为你指定的文件夹。","result":"提示「完整归档已保存并验证」，并显示归档路径。"},{"title":"需要时恢复","body":"先核验归档，再把它复制到新位置，用「设置 → 通用 → 内容库 → 选择内容库」或 `--home` 指向这份副本。","code":"showai library verify-archive /Volumes/Backup/showai-2026-10-15 --json","result":"核验通过时返回 `verified: true`、内容库 ID 和文件数。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-de010498"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"💡","tone":"blue","id":"node-e5010f9d"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"归档记录的是保存那一刻的整个内容库。它和导出不同：导出只包含一个页面或一个网站，适合分享；归档用来在换电脑、重装或误操作后找回全部项目。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ca4df872"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-e4010e0a"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"查看占用并整理空间"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"「设置 → 通用 → 内容库空间管理」按类别显示占用：正式内容、可读文件、搜索与操作索引、本机草稿、外部修改快照、恢复数据、原始内容库等；「分析项目存储空间」再按项目排序。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e3010c77"}},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"自动压缩","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"默认开启：工作台空闲一段时间后无损重新打包内容，不删除任何正式内容。也可以点「立即压缩」。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-22cffaec"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-79284473"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"检查可清理文件","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：先列出可以安全删除的生成缓存，确认后点「清理这些文件」。当前内容、原始内容库、草稿和冲突快照都受保护。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c7f82617"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-782842e0"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"重建搜索索引","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：搜索结果明显不对时使用，内容本身不受影响。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-791e7136"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7b284799"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e2010ae4"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-commands","version":"1.0.0","props":{"placeholder":"搜索内容库维护命令","groups":[{"id":"space","label":"空间"},{"id":"backup","label":"归档"},{"id":"upgrade","label":"升级"}],"commands":[{"group":"space","command":"showai library stats","summary":"按类别统计占用空间"},{"group":"space","command":"showai library compact","summary":"立即无损压缩内容"},{"group":"space","command":"showai library policy --automatic true|false","summary":"开启或关闭自动压缩；不带参数时查看当前设置"},{"group":"space","command":"showai library cleanup-plan","summary":"生成清理计划，列出可删除的生成文件","flags":[{"flag":"--older-than-days DAYS","meaning":"只考虑早于这个天数的缓存，默认 1 天"}]},{"group":"space","command":"showai library cleanup PLAN_ID","summary":"执行已审阅的清理计划","detail":"删除前会再次核对指纹和引用，计划生成后有变化的文件会被保留。"},{"group":"space","command":"showai library rebuild-index","summary":"重建搜索与引用索引"},{"group":"backup","command":"showai library archive --out ABSOLUTE_NEW_DIRECTORY","summary":"保存一份已核验的完整归档","example":"showai library archive --out /Volumes/Backup/showai-2026-10-15 --json"},{"group":"backup","command":"showai library verify-archive ARCHIVE_DIRECTORY","summary":"逐个文件核对归档摘要"},{"group":"backup","command":"showai library verify","summary":"检查当前内容库的完整性"},{"group":"upgrade","command":"showai library migrate --home PATH","summary":"原地准备、核验并启用新格式，保留原始文件"},{"group":"upgrade","command":"showai library import --source OLD_PATH --home NEW_OR_SAME_PATH","summary":"准备一次导入并生成核验报告"},{"group":"upgrade","command":"showai library activate IMPORT_ID --home PATH","summary":"审阅报告后启用导入结果"},{"group":"upgrade","command":"showai library imports --home PATH","summary":"列出已准备的导入"}]},"integrity":"sha256-f2cb922c18c3fa9d4f1aab66332746643bedee46148b4975f3ca1e16a32d3f52"},"id":"node-d900fcb9"}},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"从旧版内容库升级","open":false,"id":"node-d800fb26"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"打开旧格式的内容库时，「设置 → 通用 → 内容库」会出现「升级内容库」。升级先读取、转换并核对全部项目、页面、组件和模板版本，确认无误后才启用；原始文件作为恢复材料保留。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4c1b2781"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"旧快照缺少可靠的修改时间、作者和顺序，升级报告会单独列出。升级前请先处理当前页面的未保存修改，本机草稿会保留。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4b1b25ee"}}]},{"type":"horizontalRule","attrs":{"id":"node-dafec148"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-dbfec2db"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"接下来"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":3,"cards":[{"icon":"👥","title":"项目服务器与团队协作","body":"把项目同步到多台设备，邀请成员一起编辑。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/project-server"},{"icon":"📄","title":"页面文件格式","body":"`pages/<页面 ID>.json` 里每个字段的含义。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/file-format"},{"icon":"⌨️","title":"CLI 与 MCP 参考","body":"读取、保存、搜索和维护命令的完整清单。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/cli"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-dcfec46e"}}]},"layout":{},"surfaceViews":{"root":{"initial":null,"saved":[],"readingOrder":["node-f6762b61","node-f57629ce","node-f476283b","node-f37626a8","node-fa7631ad","node-f976301a","node-f8762e87","node-f7762cf4","node-ee761ec9","node-ed761d36","node-67041ada","node-68041c6d","node-650417b4","node-66041947","node-6304148e","node-64041621","node-61041168","node-620412fb","node-5f040e42","node-60040fd5","node-e1010951","node-e00107be","node-df01062b","node-de010498","node-e5010f9d","node-e4010e0a","node-e3010c77","node-e2010ae4","node-d900fcb9","node-d800fb26","node-dafec148","node-dbfec2db","node-dcfec46e"]}},"comments":[]}